<title>FINLAND: CITYCON PROPOSES NIL DIVIDEND FOR 1996.</title>
<headline>CITYCON PROPOSES NIL DIVIDEND FOR 1996.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		     nil vs nil</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     3.5 vs 2.0</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   0.12 vs 0.07</p>
<p> Net sales					   36.3 vs 36.6</p>
<p> Operating profit				  19.0 vs 19.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Citycon on February 14 announced a 3.5 million markka</p>
<p>pre-tax profit for 1996. Full name of Finnish real estate</p>
<p>investment company is Kiinteistosijoitus Oy Citycon.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
